341
00:42:29,900 --> 00:42:31,280
What am I magnifying?

342
00:42:32,120 --> 00:42:39,740
What am I minimizing? Am I falling into one of the traps? Perhaps, am I ignoring anything that is going well?

343
00:42:41,720 --> 00:42:50,140
Am I ignoring anything that is not going well? It's not about Pollyanna feel good at all costs. It's about being tied to reality.

344
00:42:51,120 --> 00:42:54,980
