00:44:48,780 --> 00:45:00,700
it's temporary. It's going to go away. And beliefs are self-fulfilling prophecies. If I believe that it will last for six months, it's much more likely, not necessarily, but it's much more likely to last for six months

365
00:45:00,700 --> 00:45:02,760
than if I say that too shall pass.

