00:45:07,190 --> 00:45:10,950
And what we do with our beliefs is we create a downward spiral

367
00:45:12,170 --> 00:45:21,450
of depression, unhappiness, sadness, or an upward spiral, capitalizing on positive emotions and having more and more of them.

